sequenceDiagram
  actor U as User
  participant W as PWA (WebRTC)
  participant A as voice-agent
  participant S as STT / TTS
  participant L as talker LLM
  participant B as backend + opencode
  U->>W: speaks: what did I note about micrograd
  W->>A: audio frames (20 ms)
  A->>S: stream audio
  S-->>A: partial + final transcript
  A->>A: end of turn (VAD + turn model)
  A->>L: transcript + chat context
  L-->>A: tool call ask_vault(question)
  A->>S: TTS "Let me look in your notes."
  S-->>W: speech (~1 s after you stopped)
  A->>B: POST /chats/:id/prompt, GET stream
  B-->>A: part: read entities/micrograd.md
  A->>S: TTS "Reading the micrograd page."
  B-->>A: text deltas, turn idle
  A->>L: tool result (answer text)
  L-->>A: short spoken summary
  A->>S: TTS summary
  S-->>W: speech
  W-->>U: hears answer, chat pane shows the full turn
  U->>W: interrupts: stop, just the date
  W->>A: audio → barge-in cancels TTS
